---
description: Pull requests must target the Dev branch by default
alwaysApply: true
---

# PR base branch

- Default base for all pull requests is `Dev` (not `main`, not another `save/` branch).
- When creating a PR with `gh pr create`, always pass `--base Dev`.
- When fixing a mis-targeted PR, retarget with `gh pr edit <n> --base Dev`.
- Do not open PRs against `main` or stacked `save/*` branches unless the user explicitly asks.
